I’ve completed the five source-level findings. One important result is that the premise of question 3 is not fully borne out by the current tests: the application has ORM-level `cascade_delete=True` and the superuser delete route explicitly deletes items, while the named deletion tests do not create/assert child items. I’ll document that precisely rather than inventing a regression test.
